Package: hallpass-qt
Version: 0.2.7
Section: education
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Hallpass Team <support@example.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pip, sqlite3
Recommends: python3-pyside6, python3-opencv, speech-dispatcher, espeak-ng, libqt6multimedia6, libqt6texttospeech6, qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-templates, x11-xserver-utils
Suggests: python3-venv, v4l-utils
Description: Native Touchscreen Bathroom & Water Pass System
 Lightweight offline PySide6/QtQuick kiosk for classroom pass management
 with dual timers, queue, TTS, silent photo audit and USB export.
 .
 PySide6/Qt6 and OpenCV are installed via Debian packages when available,
 otherwise the postinst falls back to pip (offline wheels can be pre-cached).
